<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<glyph name="g" format="2">
  <advance width="731"/>
  <unicode hex="0067"/>
  <note>
Double-storey g with an asymmetric ear and a flowing connector to an offset lower loop.
Weight master: 展示细体：对比明显高于 LihuiT（竖 28、横 16）。接合 42 托住发丝横画。B 的下眼比上眼更开，腰不收死。e 的横画抬得更高。M 仍是软谷，不是直线骨架。字距比 LihuiT 细体更紧。
</note>
